// UPSC Radio original introductory polity practice.
// Configure the Moodle quiz with 10 questions, 15 minutes, one mark each,
// deferred feedback, no negative marking and review only after submission.

::UR-POL-01::Which part of the Constitution of India contains Fundamental Rights? {
=Part III #Fundamental Rights are contained in Part III.
~Part II
~Part IV
~Part IX
}

::UR-POL-02::Which Article guarantees equality before the law and equal protection of the laws? {
=Article 14 #Article 14 provides these guarantees.
~Article 19
~Article 21
~Article 32
}

::UR-POL-03::Who is the ex officio Chairman of the Rajya Sabha? {
=The Vice-President of India #Article 89 provides for the Vice-President as ex officio Chairman.
~The President of India
~The Prime Minister
~The Speaker of the Lok Sabha
}

::UR-POL-04::What is the minimum age prescribed for membership of the Lok Sabha? {
=25 years #Article 84 prescribes a minimum age of 25 years for Lok Sabha membership.
~18 years
~21 years
~30 years
}

::UR-POL-05::The Directive Principles of State Policy are contained in which part of the Constitution? {
=Part IV #The Directive Principles are contained in Part IV.
~Part I
~Part III
~Part V
}

::UR-POL-06::Which body conducts elections to Parliament and the state legislatures? {
=The Election Commission of India #Article 324 vests the relevant superintendence, direction and control in the Election Commission.
~The Finance Commission
~The Union Public Service Commission
~The Comptroller and Auditor General
}

::UR-POL-07::Which Article provides the right to move the Supreme Court for enforcement of Fundamental Rights? {
=Article 32 #Article 32 guarantees the right to move the Supreme Court for this purpose.
~Article 40
~Article 51
~Article 110
}

::UR-POL-08::The 73rd Constitutional Amendment primarily concerns which institutions? {
=Panchayats #The 73rd Amendment inserted Part IX dealing with Panchayats.
~High Courts
~Municipalities
~Inter-State Councils
}

::UR-POL-09::Which constitutional body recommends the distribution of tax proceeds between the Union and the states? {
=The Finance Commission #Article 280 sets out the Finance Commission and its functions.
~The Election Commission
~The National Human Rights Commission
~The Union Public Service Commission
}

::UR-POL-10::Which provision lists the Fundamental Duties of citizens? {
=Article 51A #Fundamental Duties are listed in Article 51A in Part IVA.
~Article 21A
~Article 44
~Article 72
}
